proposal = "In sdk/x/genutil/utils.go persist recovered keys using an explicit fresh/recovery policy, refuse mismatches with existing validator files and preserve signing history rather than resetting it. Verify returned pubkey equals the key loaded after process restart for fresh mnemonic recovery and safe existing-key recovery."
